  "selected_alignment_score_max": 0.649353,
  "segments": [
    {
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "A railway station is an admirable place, although Ruskin did not think so; he did not think so because he himself was even more modern than the railway station.",
      "output_sha256": "fce4ca4dc9cc139fdfb9f176a8e890d407fb7ec3973e6796f5e5a3f8b3f7777b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 1,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 1,
      "source_human_sha256": "fce4ca4dc9cc139fdfb9f176a8e890d407fb7ec3973e6796f5e5a3f8b3f7777b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "His modernity manifested as a sort of restlessness, irritability, and an almost mechanical urgency akin to a steam engine.",
      "output_sha256": "07b44721843630063af616b4741840fa2c36cab3c8c09332cb46bc5e577d3191",
      "alignment_unit_index": 2,
      "alignment_score": 0.261353,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        2
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "e2c6275ecdac9fdf6b20454af2daa3fd07bf69131555564fe0141ba816de9197"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 2,
      "source_ai_sha256": "07b44721843630063af616b4741840fa2c36cab3c8c09332cb46bc5e577d3191",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 3,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "This mindset prevented him from appreciating the tranquil, almost sacred atmosphere that a railway station can offer.",
      "output_sha256": "47b25b07274cb533c04db330b384644c103cbb7e4db8588d8139505f912b25c1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 3,
      "alignment_score": 0.26334,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        3
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "15820889f80969a7ccbecf048cd376866e20c511ae7dd8d57915fdcfe5c9e2f2"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 3,
      "source_ai_sha256": "47b25b07274cb533c04db330b384644c103cbb7e4db8588d8139505f912b25c1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        3
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 4,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“In a railway station,” he said, “you are in a hurry, and therefore, miserable”; but you need not be either unless you are as modern as Ruskin.",
      "output_sha256": "89ba6462ad6288dbd244fe5c87842f81057582f772120790bcff0b057c3bbfdc",
      "alignment_unit_index": 4,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 4,
      "source_human_sha256": "89ba6462ad6288dbd244fe5c87842f81057582f772120790bcff0b057c3bbfdc",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 5,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "A true philosopher approaches the notion of arriving just in time for a train with a sense of humor or as a playful wager.",
      "output_sha256": "fddd31f189509e68498dbe06cb84fd5d1aaf69935ac49bd4fce7990621e7eebd",
      "alignment_unit_index": 5,
      "alignment_score": 0.458333,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        5
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "1f98975a74225f5df7f49e4c56b6186150f90495c6ecb0ba848ce5f16b22e014"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 6,
      "source_ai_sha256": "fddd31f189509e68498dbe06cb84fd5d1aaf69935ac49bd4fce7990621e7eebd",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 6,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The only way of catching a train I have ever discovered is to be late for the one before.",
      "output_sha256": "ae1d4a916f641ed01b595148137ebeba4fdaea54dcb7036a4988fdfeffd5ca59",
      "alignment_unit_index": 6,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 6,
      "source_human_sha256": "ae1d4a916f641ed01b595148137ebeba4fdaea54dcb7036a4988fdfeffd5ca59",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 7,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Do this, and you will find in a railway station much of the quietude and consolation of a cathedral.",
      "output_sha256": "8bcd8627662a47f0163e125555f973669e27482562bfa648657e035fce78095c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 7,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 7,
      "source_human_sha256": "8bcd8627662a47f0163e125555f973669e27482562bfa648657e035fce78095c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 8,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "It has many of the characteristics of a great ecclesiastical building; it has vast arches, void spaces, coloured lights, and, above all, it has recurrence or ritual.",
      "output_sha256": "766e0ed62278ac00d66d75d46546af1fc8f356ce8dab108c108ae03151dad57b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 8,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 8,
      "source_human_sha256": "766e0ed62278ac00d66d75d46546af1fc8f356ce8dab108c108ae03151dad57b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 9,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "It celebrates the primal elements of water and fire, which are central to human rituals.",
      "output_sha256": "95d9f6ae6432d3b5919228520e41d829f13d4b3e3b56790730e2dc6b5d499046",
      "alignment_unit_index": 10,
      "alignment_score": 0.49329,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        9
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "d54b2ecf36c0287073e74bdf5309bcba6fc5fa3a170a0156f4096fde70d45496"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 11,
      "source_ai_sha256": "95d9f6ae6432d3b5919228520e41d829f13d4b3e3b56790730e2dc6b5d499046",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        11
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 10,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Lastly, a station resembles the old religions rather than the new religions in this point, that people go there.",
      "output_sha256": "729bec3c1f7faa14dab8c92b84203ff29951bec7ecf610e29a481596a1bde322",
      "alignment_unit_index": 11,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 10,
      "source_human_sha256": "729bec3c1f7faa14dab8c92b84203ff29951bec7ecf610e29a481596a1bde322",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 11,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "It is worth noting that places frequented by the masses tend to preserve traditions far better than those frequented by the elite.",
      "output_sha256": "715d7401120ff96fedee24195249c787092486c63412713b6ab24e998ef7b8be",
      "alignment_unit_index": 12,
      "alignment_score": 0.247317,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        11
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "bb399b95f3d92d1d94b066346ae9b655b4e67d5157f0e40ddc88c0455431e4db"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 13,
      "source_ai_sha256": "715d7401120ff96fedee24195249c787092486c63412713b6ab24e998ef7b8be",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        13
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 12,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "The habits of everyday people don’t change as rapidly or thoroughly as those of the fashionable few.",
      "output_sha256": "f8dc37d6744935f82f4f72e346bd6b31775e02779183ca2006e28a311d0abd58",
      "alignment_unit_index": 13,
      "alignment_score": 0.319412,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        12
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "0f0b002bc0d9dcf2abd591d2ab025399d212eb9c488915a36981a9c1c2cc1cc5"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 14,
      "source_ai_sha256": "f8dc37d6744935f82f4f72e346bd6b31775e02779183ca2006e28a311d0abd58",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        14
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 13,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Ruskin could have found more memories of the Middle Ages in the Underground Railway than in the grand hotels outside the stations.",
      "output_sha256": "ff349fd2bc7b976dc3ad438d4f72ae7dc44ef447a88b09b52b6c16e40eb7407e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 14,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 13,
      "source_human_sha256": "ff349fd2bc7b976dc3ad438d4f72ae7dc44ef447a88b09b52b6c16e40eb7407e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 14,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The great palaces of pleasure which the rich build in London all have brazen and vulgar names.",
      "output_sha256": "6a0003bf20fe625c9cb895c680005f90d575137375590fa32418c0110f903ee9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 15,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 14,
      "source_human_sha256": "6a0003bf20fe625c9cb895c680005f90d575137375590fa32418c0110f903ee9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 15,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Their names are either snobbish, like the Hotel Cecil, or (worse still) cosmopolitan like the Hotel Metropole.",
      "output_sha256": "9281f47070d608ef4ba9180102af0e0ac529640000cbea9ea0198f210b9be31a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 16,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 15,
      "source_human_sha256": "9281f47070d608ef4ba9180102af0e0ac529640000cbea9ea0198f210b9be31a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 16,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "However, when I travel in a third-class carriage from the local circle station to Battersea and then to the circle station near the DAILY NEWS, the names of the stations resonate with solemn historical significance.",
      "output_sha256": "e6eb901dd9ca9d3bd2eb350b5ddca05d9c7829426695c9793ba9f50e85bd773b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 17,
      "alignment_score": 0.649353,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        16
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "9d09b6e58469aa41587f8b551b337bd60f55a538f34fc0c718dd1565ad4da147"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 18,
      "source_ai_sha256": "e6eb901dd9ca9d3bd2eb350b5ddca05d9c7829426695c9793ba9f50e85bd773b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        18
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 17,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Leaving Victoria I come to a park belonging especially to St. James the Apostle; thence I go to Westminster Bridge, whose very name alludes to the awful Abbey; Charing Cross holds up the symbol of Christendom; the next station is called a Temple; and Blackfriars remembers the mediaeval dream of a Brotherhood.",
      "output_sha256": "3e38f60c9c2a34befb1e1ffc7b96facbd4b6219d6355e3a04e947b27942c5064",
      "alignment_unit_index": 18,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 17,
      "source_human_sha256": "3e38f60c9c2a34befb1e1ffc7b96facbd4b6219d6355e3a04e947b27942c5064",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 18,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "If you wish to find the past preserved, follow the million feet of the crowd.",
      "output_sha256": "df5068b17e60424b2fdc063cbfc62152b1ceb09aadbffaea2c5db0401c9851af",
      "alignment_unit_index": 19,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 18,
      "source_human_sha256": "df5068b17e60424b2fdc063cbfc62152b1ceb09aadbffaea2c5db0401c9851af",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 19,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "At the worst the uneducated only wear down old things by sheer walking.",
      "output_sha256": "1348f9a3b9d8c16fbebfa40bb277997b13552c5f954129d85803097d1d4ecbf0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 20,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 19,
      "source_human_sha256": "1348f9a3b9d8c16fbebfa40bb277997b13552c5f954129d85803097d1d4ecbf0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 20,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "But the educated kick them down out of sheer culture.",
      "output_sha256": "e174e2ef1068d47b00a96e735c5cd44edd308657ca1db87b31e1f5ae58527eec",
      "alignment_unit_index": 20,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 20,
      "source_human_sha256": "e174e2ef1068d47b00a96e735c5cd44edd308657ca1db87b31e1f5ae58527eec",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 21,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I feel all this profoundly as I wander about the empty railway station, where I have no business of any kind.",
      "output_sha256": "ecba05699d33048110213bc983ca04fecbbec8c02edb162d608a1f62535fab92",
      "alignment_unit_index": 21,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 21,
      "source_human_sha256": "ecba05699d33048110213bc983ca04fecbbec8c02edb162d608a1f62535fab92",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 22,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I have extracted a vast number of chocolates from automatic machines; I have obtained cigarettes, toffee, scent, and other things that I dislike by the same machinery; I have weighed myself, with sublime results; and this sense, not only of the healthiness of popular things, but of their essential antiquity and permanence, is still in possession of my mind.",
      "output_sha256": "d09ea43bc95e8531bf17dc0427f3149418a34a68a793686448532512d86fb94c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 22,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 22,
      "source_human_sha256": "d09ea43bc95e8531bf17dc0427f3149418a34a68a793686448532512d86fb94c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 23,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Meandering to the bookstall, I find my faith intact, even amidst the chaotic landscape of contemporary literature and journalism.",
      "output_sha256": "726e2a11c4ca915eafee03c45ebf7738e51b3d88dea77aba3f552d23a6e8e3d8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 23,
      "alignment_score": 0.54386,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        23
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "1573dea2780f1fb1f866a954f16db3e9cf8339ed2818d8a4c665e1e3e9c132b3"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 25,
      "source_ai_sha256": "726e2a11c4ca915eafee03c45ebf7738e51b3d88dea77aba3f552d23a6e8e3d8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        25
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 24,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Even in the crudest and most clamorous aspects of the newspaper world I still prefer the popular to the proud and fastidious.",
      "output_sha256": "1cd3b1f8b016dde8ddcc4e4410979f721a3319f237eb08063ebde3230fcafbf5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 24,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 24,
      "source_human_sha256": "1cd3b1f8b016dde8ddcc4e4410979f721a3319f237eb08063ebde3230fcafbf5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 25,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "If I had to choose between taking in the DAILY MAIL and taking in the TIMES (the dilemma reminds one of a nightmare), I should certainly cry out with the whole of my being for the DAILY MAIL.",
      "output_sha256": "c544b852b9287334ffd48358ffde4cc8dc6800d17abce526ed96bdfb0d96b186",
      "alignment_unit_index": 25,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 25,
      "source_human_sha256": "c544b852b9287334ffd48358ffde4cc8dc6800d17abce526ed96bdfb0d96b186",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 26,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Even the triviality of its grandiosity is less irksome than the pettiness that is often cloaked in solemnity.",
      "output_sha256": "8fd87c08262b337bfe0d22a79e2ba4c08ed2e3c98027f533c977c2778895d031",
      "alignment_unit_index": 26,
      "alignment_score": 0.274426,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        26
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "cae7f84443aebebfbb35815c17d0c682e6be6b150317116794bdf4852f41fb48"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 28,
      "source_ai_sha256": "8fd87c08262b337bfe0d22a79e2ba4c08ed2e3c98027f533c977c2778895d031",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        28
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 27,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "People buy the DAILY MAIL, but they do not believe in it.",
      "output_sha256": "a537dfe7abe1884dc1dd9791e280f23381d708fcd3cbe97af03601d59b415ba7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 27,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 27,
      "source_human_sha256": "a537dfe7abe1884dc1dd9791e280f23381d708fcd3cbe97af03601d59b415ba7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 28,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "They do believe in the TIMES, and (apparently) they do not buy it.",
      "output_sha256": "3a52a8c1312101163fcfbda437e4505b0f7a88e37e38587415bddd0e1c39d956",
      "alignment_unit_index": 28,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 28,
      "source_human_sha256": "3a52a8c1312101163fcfbda437e4505b0f7a88e37e38587415bddd0e1c39d956",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 29,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "But the more the output of paper upon the modern world is actually studied, the more it will be found to be in all its essentials ancient and human, like the name of Charing Cross.",
      "output_sha256": "c18471a994279b114da78eebc78f8870e69519a64ed6ffee5d72f304d1049895",
      "alignment_unit_index": 29,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 29,
      "source_human_sha256": "c18471a994279b114da78eebc78f8870e69519a64ed6ffee5d72f304d1049895",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 30,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Should you linger at a station bookstall for a few hours—as I often do—you might find that it gradually acquires the monumental significance akin to that of the Vatican or the Bodleian Library.",
      "output_sha256": "2dc4aff2ab12098252a3983f88b356ec3562ec1f9f34e6f657ab277dd24c5c4d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 30,
      "alignment_score": 0.572112,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        30
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "bbd904f7f95b53c270441b6e91eead29c013f1bbbb2cc5286497af246351d3f4"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 32,
      "source_ai_sha256": "2dc4aff2ab12098252a3983f88b356ec3562ec1f9f34e6f657ab277dd24c5c4d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        32
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 31,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The novelty is all superficial; the tradition is all interior and profound.",
      "output_sha256": "bf3f5decd92f39697895a469dd8ab8c0fdef5dbfa65ca7e644b0e3992000629a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 31,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 31,
      "source_human_sha256": "bf3f5decd92f39697895a469dd8ab8c0fdef5dbfa65ca7e644b0e3992000629a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 32,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "The DAILY MAIL may produce new editions, but it lacks truly original ideas.",
      "output_sha256": "f98bcbdd46813ada4de3a6e969cc6b125bdeaa6d8ccb77c869c155ebca3cb45d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 32,
      "alignment_score": 0.544231,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        32
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "eae732ab4ad2b25ed5bee6452af36936f2ea5a07de63ebb77a6a6e279c1c707a"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 34,
      "source_ai_sha256": "f98bcbdd46813ada4de3a6e969cc6b125bdeaa6d8ccb77c869c155ebca3cb45d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        34
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 33,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Ultimately, every article that strays from the age-old human emotions of faith or homeland circles back to the age-old human fascination with gossip.",
      "output_sha256": "9194932b40d96c550a8f3c824d7ac872a685f06890d554f5e93e2e0bf8c8c390",
      "alignment_unit_index": 33,
      "alignment_score": 0.382883,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        33
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "0bac965d326031b8de33a44c23305b2747d151fbe52e5a9da1f1ee45a420e244"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 35,
      "source_ai_sha256": "9194932b40d96c550a8f3c824d7ac872a685f06890d554f5e93e2e0bf8c8c390",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        35
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 34,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Modern writers have often made game of the old chronicles because they chiefly record accidents and prodigies; a church struck by lightning, or a calf with six legs.",
      "output_sha256": "c19dbd57e5e9d6dfceb3b3323604505e5f6a8b74da2288302f77dbe96958ec3e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 34,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 34,
      "source_human_sha256": "c19dbd57e5e9d6dfceb3b3323604505e5f6a8b74da2288302f77dbe96958ec3e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 35,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "They do not seem to realise that this old barbaric history is the same as new democratic journalism.",
      "output_sha256": "a14c97c2f57ed8f26654631e9e160ccfc673557d19868d8c2578740d59494d44",
      "alignment_unit_index": 35,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 35,
      "source_human_sha256": "a14c97c2f57ed8f26654631e9e160ccfc673557d19868d8c2578740d59494d44",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 36,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "It is not that the savage chronicle has disappeared.",
      "output_sha256": "e1b0003b608dc9b35b8ca8eb0f4171d4ad9f8921ff0473cc9c011fda0ef20f06",
      "alignment_unit_index": 35,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 36,
      "source_human_sha256": "e1b0003b608dc9b35b8ca8eb0f4171d4ad9f8921ff0473cc9c011fda0ef20f06",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 37,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "It is merely that the savage chronicle now appears every morning.",
      "output_sha256": "336a8903c7f0ab62b20e7e39774d2c44bd0926705a9fd475f06a06f494825875",
      "alignment_unit_index": 35,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 37,
      "source_human_sha256": "336a8903c7f0ab62b20e7e39774d2c44bd0926705a9fd475f06a06f494825875",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 38,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "As I drift in front of the bookstall, a striking title catches my eye, and for a brief moment, it astonishes me.",
      "output_sha256": "eff1f4706516879ca9a5f6e6518b5ec66dad4df261654ffd907d8911297fedd6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 36,
      "alignment_score": 0.527564,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        38
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "b75274817373da30e55ea4a4b2ce43aba36ea822670bdcf7a7e3beb1f7ca2467"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 38,
      "source_ai_sha256": "eff1f4706516879ca9a5f6e6518b5ec66dad4df261654ffd907d8911297fedd6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        38
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 39,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "On the outside of a book I saw written in large letters, “Get On or Get Out.”",
      "output_sha256": "6ce1875dff6a4df2f28dabcbb6c1a0ff7ccd4cd824408f0797b589242f75213e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 37,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 39,
      "source_human_sha256": "6ce1875dff6a4df2f28dabcbb6c1a0ff7ccd4cd824408f0797b589242f75213e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 40,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The title of the book recalled to me with a sudden revolt and reaction all that does seem unquestionably new and nasty; it reminded me that there was in the world of to-day that utterly idiotic thing, a worship of success; a thing that only means surpassing anybody in anything; a thing that may mean being the most successful person in running away from a battle; a thing that may mean being the most successfully sleepy of the whole row of sleeping men.",
      "output_sha256": "a7a632ab927cf4a89dd2090feb53ccf4fd92986ec170d919aa0e51a537cc60f7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 38,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 40,
      "source_human_sha256": "a7a632ab927cf4a89dd2090feb53ccf4fd92986ec170d919aa0e51a537cc60f7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 41,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Upon seeing those words, the sacred aura of the railway station momentarily dimmed.",
      "output_sha256": "7fd0b5f22aa48ca397e52b97f9b8280e5e63d86a7c37800439c93c4de99123d7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 39,
      "alignment_score": 0.42267,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        41
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "8b6a024b4c36b93f799af319108b3d16cbb1bacf6be66529299c68059147e139"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 42,
      "source_ai_sha256": "7fd0b5f22aa48ca397e52b97f9b8280e5e63d86a7c37800439c93c4de99123d7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        42
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 42,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Here, I thought, there is at any rate something anarchic and violent and vile.",
      "output_sha256": "0797e90a79b7da4f8cd16787bca77bc1019ff3a9f1935c2caf9bb6297fd76fe8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 40,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 42,
      "source_human_sha256": "0797e90a79b7da4f8cd16787bca77bc1019ff3a9f1935c2caf9bb6297fd76fe8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 43,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "I noted that this phrase embodied a disturbing form of violent individualism prevalent in our society.",
      "output_sha256": "248c383d75541be51ba96b40a9bbf8ac3e4acc62893077eb2f604b0f46035eb0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 41,
      "alignment_score": 0.252647,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        43
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "aaa36583e091a977946421d3fa43abca36857c533039c3b4d5f9d0591bcf6424"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 43,
      "source_ai_sha256": "248c383d75541be51ba96b40a9bbf8ac3e4acc62893077eb2f604b0f46035eb0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        43
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 44,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "In a fit of frustration and resolve, I made the ill-advised choice to purchase the book, thus transferring some of my funds to what I viewed as an adversary.",
      "output_sha256": "262015bc5dcee2d10f2c52109f39ce26f4b7761645cdfa3ebcdb5202d74d7fce",
      "alignment_unit_index": 42,
      "alignment_score": 0.357462,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        44
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "3159dc68a4b29fbe68a669f6119c4c106c2522f5d16923ae154de4a7f7e92bc1"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 44,
      "source_ai_sha256": "262015bc5dcee2d10f2c52109f39ce26f4b7761645cdfa3ebcdb5202d74d7fce",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        44
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 45,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "I opened it, bracing myself for the expected brutality and blasphemy that would contradict the generally serene atmosphere of the station.",
      "output_sha256": "b0f99484ee7fb29dfbb8ad72127aca12ff7daa0605deca250cbaef47175e6e78",
      "alignment_unit_index": 43,
      "alignment_score": 0.449456,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        45
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "f3765cd51258dadf1b9b7083716dcef0e1ba1ad90758f355da96b1bd4336b53b"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 45,
      "source_ai_sha256": "b0f99484ee7fb29dfbb8ad72127aca12ff7daa0605deca250cbaef47175e6e78",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        45
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 46,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I was prepared to find something in the book that was as infamous as its title.",
      "output_sha256": "fd4b00397d58233a05916798cf90f7b4276dd2f40b6f654dd0efbbc3f9914c87",
      "alignment_unit_index": 44,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 46,
      "source_human_sha256": "fd4b00397d58233a05916798cf90f7b4276dd2f40b6f654dd0efbbc3f9914c87",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 47,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I was disappointed.",
      "output_sha256": "9f64b348d41ae3945e66c8b812a8c10261786ab3d74110d1748bc653daf70cd0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 45,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 47,
      "source_human_sha256": "9f64b348d41ae3945e66c8b812a8c10261786ab3d74110d1748bc653daf70cd0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 48,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "There was nothing at all corresponding to the furious decisiveness of the remarks on the cover.",
      "output_sha256": "02ae178212d437927e6dc644a58344e81b3ba2a73430ec0574a791181c6ee7c6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 45,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 48,
      "source_human_sha256": "02ae178212d437927e6dc644a58344e81b3ba2a73430ec0574a791181c6ee7c6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 49,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "After a careful reading, I found myself unsure whether I was meant to “get on” or “get out,” yet I felt a vague inclination to choose the latter.",
      "output_sha256": "a11a2681b8a9577271fcd8cc6d68fe76f70ed0dd71aeb9e0bcd4fca032a948d5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 46,
      "alignment_score": 0.543261,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        49
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "1ffbf213b33a4272062a439415a2e4615d394be33264d9b79c620f10b38e9ba7"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 48,
      "source_ai_sha256": "a11a2681b8a9577271fcd8cc6d68fe76f70ed0dd71aeb9e0bcd4fca032a948d5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        48
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 50,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "A considerable part of the book, particularly towards the end, was concerned with a detailed description of the life of Napoleon Bonaparte.",
      "output_sha256": "73e93bf46d1a178128f5b80161436b755f16638d5bb4f271bf7e87900bdb49c2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 47,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 50,
      "source_human_sha256": "73e93bf46d1a178128f5b80161436b755f16638d5bb4f271bf7e87900bdb49c2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 51,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Undoubtedly Napoleon got on.",
      "output_sha256": "e16e728c7006db832263f1f5e74eabbb26a90967ce09414c204d07b4dfbb0136",
      "alignment_unit_index": 48,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 51,
      "source_human_sha256": "e16e728c7006db832263f1f5e74eabbb26a90967ce09414c204d07b4dfbb0136",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 52,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "He also got out.",
      "output_sha256": "ce31af7cdb3266533f5d43d4f37a52f6e7f2f17c0d57c61dd012faadcac2564f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 48,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 52,
      "source_human_sha256": "ce31af7cdb3266533f5d43d4f37a52f6e7f2f17c0d57c61dd012faadcac2564f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 53,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "However, I struggled to grasp how the anecdotes presented in this text were meant to guide someone on the path to success.",
      "output_sha256": "bec9571b98b982bb0e15413a2053f2fecc58d59b7b100c9b3afd62c0750c188a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 49,
      "alignment_score": 0.315894,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        53
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "629558a1ad47bcef741ce894063a2d2d19822e525aadb339b299ad04018a20cd"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 51,
      "source_ai_sha256": "bec9571b98b982bb0e15413a2053f2fecc58d59b7b100c9b3afd62c0750c188a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        51
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 54,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "One anecdote described how Napoleon always wiped his pen on his knee-breeches.",
      "output_sha256": "d2f4f9b36224741a369345ef3558a4fe8aedc261c8095b4ce90164cc092892ba",
      "alignment_unit_index": 50,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 54,
      "source_human_sha256": "d2f4f9b36224741a369345ef3558a4fe8aedc261c8095b4ce90164cc092892ba",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 55,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I suppose the moral is: always wipe your pen on your knee-breeches, and you will win the battle of Wagram.",
      "output_sha256": "851d1bd2f2dd3c2f284fd84077c8921d8a8f4d07f6f2be3fb55e6e0858514c3b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 50,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 55,
      "source_human_sha256": "851d1bd2f2dd3c2f284fd84077c8921d8a8f4d07f6f2be3fb55e6e0858514c3b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 56,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Another story told that he let loose a gazelle among the ladies of his Court.",
      "output_sha256": "df2b019bfad7fd0f152133e918c3bbaf0afb3ef334fd1f9a7d491814fc5b42d2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 51,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 56,
      "source_human_sha256": "df2b019bfad7fd0f152133e918c3bbaf0afb3ef334fd1f9a7d491814fc5b42d2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 57,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Clearly the brutal practical inference is—loose a gazelle among the ladies of your acquaintance, and you will be Emperor of the French.",
      "output_sha256": "17c0cb9d39e1035dcc1a4d652a1474a369af45c8bd09d142151ce59b80c6dd86",
      "alignment_unit_index": 51,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 57,
      "source_human_sha256": "17c0cb9d39e1035dcc1a4d652a1474a369af45c8bd09d142151ce59b80c6dd86",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 58,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Get on with a gazelle or get out.",
      "output_sha256": "f879854b7d712cc3bd25777f2f6b46d2b98aa9134e4e843a7c3f857b033ea2c8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 52,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 58,
      "source_human_sha256": "f879854b7d712cc3bd25777f2f6b46d2b98aa9134e4e843a7c3f857b033ea2c8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 59,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The book entirely reconciled me to the soft twilight of the station.",
      "output_sha256": "621b30e86d14c7cdd62d6af5b87bf9d6238897124163a2ab05b059502be5de1b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 53,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 59,
      "source_human_sha256": "621b30e86d14c7cdd62d6af5b87bf9d6238897124163a2ab05b059502be5de1b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 60,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Then I suddenly saw that there was a symbolic division which might be paralleled from biology.",
      "output_sha256": "b7126d2fba845978186ed2920f559e247cfa420a7e1ff75896cb654a3cecbf50",
      "alignment_unit_index": 54,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 60,
      "source_human_sha256": "b7126d2fba845978186ed2920f559e247cfa420a7e1ff75896cb654a3cecbf50",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 61,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Brave men are vertebrates; they have their softness on the surface and their toughness in the middle.",
      "output_sha256": "0b77695055ad8917fc85eb9220a19d8b5d4816c370aa4f638f10cdc07fa87213",
      "alignment_unit_index": 54,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 61,
      "source_human_sha256": "0b77695055ad8917fc85eb9220a19d8b5d4816c370aa4f638f10cdc07fa87213",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 62,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "In contrast, today’s fearful souls resemble crustaceans—hard on the outside but soft within.",
      "output_sha256": "8be28ecd43e1f420e446cba9a44ec687c18dfad175f1957d906fcbb805981994",
      "alignment_unit_index": 55,
      "alignment_score": 0.245853,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        62
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "6fbe6fa5de337f4188d645f8bf140a27acdb6a5e5d07a5eb4ccbd408d785b30b"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 57,
      "source_ai_sha256": "8be28ecd43e1f420e446cba9a44ec687c18dfad175f1957d906fcbb805981994",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        57
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 63,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Yet, within this twilight space, that softness is omnipresent.",
      "output_sha256": "cbbab4cb466d0098f536050b3d96166c7bc846ec304e27f07cad7c3d414206c4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 56,
      "alignment_score": 0.302381,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        63
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "bdbd970c17ea357962b5252f1034f90ed5b0247e85e0edc63bb1ea1f28518ae5"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 58,
      "source_ai_sha256": "cbbab4cb466d0098f536050b3d96166c7bc846ec304e27f07cad7c3d414206c4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        58
      ]
    }
  ]
}
